{"id":72799,"date":"2026-11-05T18:30:59","date_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:30:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72799"},"modified":"2026-11-05T19:32:51","modified_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:32:51","slug":"mahfra-nature-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/mahfra-nature-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Mahfra Nature Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mahfra Nature Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Mahfra Nature Trail 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> no <strong>Parque Desportivo Municipal Eng\u00ba Ministro dos Santos<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizado pela equipa <strong>Trail4U<\/strong>, o evento integra oficialmente a <em>Mafra Trail Running Series<\/em>, a <em>Merrell Trail Running Series<\/em> e o <em>Circuito de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa<\/em>, percorrendo trilhos naturais, vales e zonas rurais do concelho mafrense.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo \u00e9 composto pelo <strong>Trail Longo de 24 km<\/strong> (1.000 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:00), pelo <strong>Trail Curto de 13 km<\/strong> (650 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:00) e por uma <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> de lazer (partida \u00e0s 09:05), com tempo limite global de 6 horas e cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios prevista para as 12:30. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a 600 participantes at\u00e9 28 de fevereiro de 2027 e incluem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal (com chip no Trail Longo e Trail Curto), seguro desportivo e abastecimentos em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/str