letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:05 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 6h00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">13,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 03\/01) | 14,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/01) | 16,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 28\/02)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Mahfra Nature Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Mahfra Nature Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 Piscina do Parque Desportivo Municipal Eng\u00ba Ministro dos Santos (Av. Dr. Francisco S\u00e1 Carneiro, Mafra, Lisboa). O Trail Longo (24 km) e o Trail Curto (13 km) partem \u00e0s 09:00, seguidos da Caminhada \u00e0s 09:05.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Mahfra Nature Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases at\u00e9 28 de fevereiro de 2027 (limite de 600 vagas pagas): 1\u00aa fase (06\/11\/2026 a 03\/01\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 18 \u20ac, Trail Curto 14 \u20ac, Caminhada 13 \u20ac; 2\u00aa fase (04\/01 a 31\/01\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 20 \u20ac, Trail Curto 16 \u20ac, Caminhada 14 \u20ac; 3\u00aa fase (01\/02 a 28\/02\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 24 \u20ac, Trail Curto 18 \u20ac, Caminhada 16 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o desn\u00edvel positivo e o tempo limite das provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo de 24 km acumula 1.000 m de desn\u00edvel positivo (D+) e o Trail Curto de 13 km apresenta 650 m D+. O tempo limite global \u00e9 de 6 horas, controlado na linha de chegada.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que circuitos integram o Mahfra Nature Trail 2027 e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova integra a Mafra Trail Running Series, a Merrell Trail Running Series e o Circuito de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt oficial, dorsal (com chip nas provas competitivas), seguro desportivo e abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos (\u00e9 necess\u00e1rio transportar recipiente pr\u00f3prio, pois n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos descart\u00e1veis).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e o hor\u00e1rio do secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Trail4U (contactos: trail4uevents@gmail.com e 969 463 510). No dia da prova, o secretariado funciona na Piscina do Parque Desportivo Municipal de Mafra entre as 07:00 e as 08:45.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Mahfra Nature Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mafra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Mahfra Nature Trail 2027 realiza-se a 7 de mar\u00e7o em Mafra (Lisboa). Provas de Trail Longo 24 km, Trail Curto 13 km e Caminhada. Garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-mahfra-nature-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 24 km\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/mahfra-nature-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 13 km\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/mahfra-nature-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/mahfra-nature-trail-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Trail4U\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Mahfra Nature Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Mahfra Nature Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 Piscina do Parque Desportivo Municipal Eng\u00ba Ministro dos Santos (Av. Dr. Francisco S\u00e1 Carneiro, Mafra, Lisboa). O Trail Longo (24 km) e o Trail Curto (13 km) partem \u00e0s 09:00, seguidos da Caminhada \u00e0s 09:05.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Mahfra Nature Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases at\u00e9 28 de fevereiro de 2027 (limite de 600 vagas pagas): 1\u00aa fase (06\/11\/2026 a 03\/01\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 18 \u20ac, Trail Curto 14 \u20ac, Caminhada 13 \u20ac; 2\u00aa fase (04\/01 a 31\/01\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 20 \u20ac, Trail Curto 16 \u20ac, Caminhada 14 \u20ac; 3\u00aa fase (01\/02 a 28\/02\/2027) \u2014 Trail Longo 24 \u20ac, Trail Curto 18 \u20ac, Caminhada 16 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o desn\u00edvel positivo e o tempo limite das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo de 24 km acumula 1.000 m de desn\u00edvel positivo (D+) e o Trail Curto de 13 km apresenta 650 m D+. O tempo limite global \u00e9 de 6 horas, controlado na linha de chegada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que circuitos integram o Mahfra Nature Trail 2027 e o que inclui o kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova integra a Mafra Trail Running Series, a Merrell Trail Running Series e o Circuito de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt oficial, dorsal (com chip nas provas competitivas), seguro desportivo e abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos (\u00e9 necess\u00e1rio transportar recipiente pr\u00f3prio, pois n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos descart\u00e1veis).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e o hor\u00e1rio do secretariado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Trail4U (contactos: trail4uevents@gmail.com e 969 463 510). No dia da prova, o secretariado funciona na Piscina do Parque Desportivo Municipal de Mafra entre as 07:00 e as 08:45.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72800,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[]